---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const ld = {
 "@context": "https://schema.org",
 "@type": "ContactPage",
 "url": "https://lvgwildlife.com/contact",
 "name": "Contact LVG Wildlife Solutions",
 "mainEntity": {
  "@id": "https://lvgwildlife.com/#business",
  "@type": "ProfessionalService",
  "name": "LVG Wildlife Solutions",
  "alternateName": "Land Value Group Wildlife Solutions",
  "areaServed": [
   {
    "@type": "State",
    "name": "Texas"
   },
   {
    "@type": "State",
    "name": "Oklahoma"
   }
  ]
 }
};
---
<Base
  title={"Contact LVG Wildlife Solutions | Request a Property Assessment"}
  description={"Request a wildlife property assessment in Texas or Oklahoma. Tell us about your land and what you want from it. We reply within a couple of days."}
  path="/contact"
  ogTitle={"Contact LVG Wildlife Solutions"}
  ogDescription={"Tell us about your property. Assessments, wildlife management plans, and habitat management across Texas and Oklahoma."}
  robots="index,follow,max-image-preview:large"
  current="contact"
  ld={ld}
  mcta={{"title": "Property assessment", "line": "We reply within a couple of days", "href": "#name", "label": "Start the form"}}
>
<!-- ===================== PAGE HEAD ===================== -->
<section class="dark topo-gold deep pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="idx"><i></i><s></s><b>GET IN TOUCH</b></div>
    <h1>Request a property assessment</h1>
    <p class="lead">You do not need to have anything figured out first. Most owners reach out because something is not working and they are not sure why. That is the normal starting point.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== FORM ===================== -->
<section class="topo-ink shift-2 seam">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cgrid">
      <div>
        <h2 class="h2s">What happens after you reach out</h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>We read every inquiry ourselves, and you will hear back within a couple of days, usually sooner. The first conversation is us learning your property and what you want out of it.</p>
          <p>From there we get a visit on the calendar and send you a short intake form so the time we spend on the ground counts for something. Every property we take on is a partnership. You know this place better than anyone; we know what to look for.</p>
          <p>If the Texas wildlife tax exemption is one of your goals, say so and we will factor it in from the start.</p>
          <p>You are welcome to read <a href='/#services'>what the assessment covers</a>, <a href='/wildlife-tax-valuation'>how the wildlife tax exemption works</a>, or the <a href='/#questions'>common questions</a> first.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="h2s" style="margin-top:2.25rem">Where we work</h2>
        <dl class="direct">
          <div><dt>Service area</dt><dd>Texas and Oklahoma</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <form name="property-inquiry" method="POST" data-netlify="true"
            data-netlify-honeypot="bot-field" action="/thanks">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="property-inquiry">
        <input type="hidden" name="source" value="contact page">
        <p class="hp"><label>Do not fill this in<input name="bot-field"></label></p>
        <div class="row2">
          <div class="fld"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></div>
          <div class="fld"><label for="phone">Phone</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="fld"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
        <div class="row2">
          <div class="fld"><label for="location">County and state</label><input id="location" name="location" type="text" placeholder="Hunt County, TX"></div>
          <div class="fld"><label for="acres">Approximate acres <span class="opt">if known</span></label><input id="acres" name="acres" type="text"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="fld"><label for="interest">What do you need help with?</label>
          <select id="interest" name="interest">
            <option>A property assessment</option>
            <option>A wildlife management plan</option>
            <option>Wildlife tax exemption for my Texas property</option>
            <option>Whitetail and habitat work</option>
            <option>Not sure yet</option>
          </select></div>
        <div class="fld"><label for="tenure">Is any of it leased rather than owned? <span class="opt">optional</span></label>
          <input id="tenure" name="tenure" type="text" placeholder="All deeded, or 100 acres on a state lease"></div>
        <div class="fld"><label for="goal">What are you hoping to accomplish?</label>
          <textarea id="goal" name="goal" placeholder="What is frustrating you, or what you would like the property to be doing"></textarea></div>
        <button class="btn p" type="submit">Send inquiry</button>
        <p class="fine">We will only use this to reply to you. No lists, no newsletters.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
